{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"state","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"aside","name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The merge prefers the in-memory value for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"every","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" ID"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already in memory, and never removes entities. Mid-session, remote"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"edits","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" to entities you already hold and remote "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"deletions","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" therefore"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"do not surface until the next launch — re-hydration is additive-only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by design. That is the price of never clobbering unflushed writes or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"live UI edits; per-ID dirty tracking that relaxes this is a possible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"future refinement."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pending writes and deletions are flushed to disk "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the merge, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remote-change refresh that fires during the debounce window can’t read a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stale disk row for an entity the user just edited or deleted and resurrect"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it. This mirrors "},{"code":"SyncCoordinator.setSyncEnabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s flush-first discipline"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and makes every "},{"code":"rehydrate","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" caller safe by construction."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a fetch fails, the corresponding "},{"code":"EntityStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is left untouched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the failure is reported via "},{"code":"onFailure","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rehydrate","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"into","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"inout","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"State","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:17SwiduxPersistence0B11CoordinatorC9rehydrate4intoyxz_tYaF","title":"rehydrate(into:)","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxPersistence"}]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator\/rehydrate(into:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence","doc:\/\/SwiduxPersistence\/documentation\/SwiduxPersistence\/PersistenceCoordinator"]]},"variants":[{"paths